# The exact denial each document in connector-inventory-invented-deployment.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
Deployment cloudflare-public/third-site-tunnel is outside the reviewed connector inventory
Deployment cloudflare-public/third-site-tunnel may take its Tunnel token only from the Secret derived from its own app.kubernetes.io/instance, through env.valueFrom.secretKeyRef and never through envFrom
